ketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-LZcROnrGtcQ7kNvwGw-yey&_nc_oc=AdokBz3lDmaOg02C-_qdx2ajWfB432YT4Tstc1jwOSfJk8VNjX8FfJwVFFhwr1JfVx0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ4XQjhC3RZFYwN2co5YquqTl4sOrvH5S8x9vigLMvilA&oe=6B09B55C"}, {"file_name": "GlobalLeaderboards_Image.png", "id": "556916340796636", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618051_556916344129969_4630520520253278561_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g1UMsp3-dkIQ7kNvwHJtccQ&_nc_oc=AdoycSiPn1VMk27VGlb9_Sied-piw63Iwz3NsUSOc5CqUaVVgsoJgTcIw2OJUfU74So&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQf61iWlHiz3IGA-weoF4WckI8ezKl4wmv_etUZSVKU3A&oe=6B09BEA0"}, {"file_name": "ChallengeMode_Image.png", "id": "1238200904331680", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499301526_1238200907665013_4439728854047711627_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_cbhntIF4kEQ7kNvwGLutaC&_nc_oc=AdpF87HkbwkqbJL8jI_KhY8uJnrdkbiPVLzoSf0Zut0mSN6fx5D_SGq7P50j4lZ47fI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQmae6MIIznOcWBbZW8cE_YwQnPbWwvaVmVe40bXIMI6Q&oe=6B09B46B"}, {"file_name": "Cosmetics_Image.png", "id": "1366120307973125", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300977_1366120311306458_2475007633126940757_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0XkL8-gRhGoQ7kNvwFVZZr-&_nc_oc=AdqhRwChdCWv8RIx4AfsoOuGyWHooNI8CrKK7esZF-l_haSSju1Bty5G7zuB3giHe2U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQZr2geTJn_3xigZaX4MlRfG9aKSRJsSdH514zH2fYY4A&oe=6B09AC3B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Punch Bomb", "keywords": ["Punch", "Arcade", "Bomb", "Game", "Challenge"], "long_description": "# Do you like to punch things?!\nPunch Bomb is an intense action arcade game where you punch things designed from the ground up for those who like a challenge!\n\nThis game **IS NOT EASY**\n\nClimb the global leaderboards in 3 punchable game modes!\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n# Classic Mode\n\n\n\nSurvive for as long as you can while punching a variety of bombs away from you before they explode, racking up huge combos, hitting targets, and dodging dangerous laser obstacles!\n{4009259875886708}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n\n# Blitz Mode\n\nRegular bombs no longer explode in this mode, and targets extend your time. Go ballistic to try to get as high of a score as possible within the time limit!\n{1063827595628759}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n\n# Challenge Mode\nComplete a fun collection of small challenges that put your speed and accuracy to the test!\n{1207719874395696}\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Unique Cosmetics\nUnlock a variety of unique cosmetics by **PLAYING THE GAME** if you're up for a good challenge! Each with their own unique particle effect!\n\n\n\n\n{1198946195348915}", "short_description": "Do you like to punch things?! Punching bombs away from you before they explode while dodging dangerous laser obstacles and hitting targets! Compete in global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://punchbomb.com/punchbombTOS.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://punchbomb.com/punchbombTOS.html", "publisher_name": "Chris Folea Makes Things", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.punchbomb.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": 